1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,111
As Uke comes to strike with the knife

2
00:00:02,112 --> 00:00:04,914
step in deeply to his rear 
turning at the same time.

3
00:00:04,915 --> 00:00:06,807
As you do so control the wrist,

4
00:00:06,808 --> 00:00:10,754
making sure that the other hand is 
over the fingers closed against the knife,

5
00:00:10,755 --> 00:00:14,353
as you turn to throw control Uke's wrist 
and elbow to turn him over,

6
00:00:18,154 --> 00:00:22,601
then bring your weight forward pressing down 
on the wrist until Uke releases the knife.

